_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m013-0156","start":156,"end":157,"surface":"朔","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002270","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao","book_id":"b-shiji-043","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-043-zhao"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p015","text":"晉景公之三年，大夫屠岸賈欲誅趙氏。初，趙盾在時，夢見叔帶持要而哭，甚悲；已而笑，拊手且歌。盾卜之，兆絶而後好。趙史援占之，曰：「此夢甚惡，非君之身，乃君之子，然亦君之咎。至孫，趙將世益衰。」屠岸賈者，始有寵於靈公，及至於景公而賈爲司寇，將作難，乃治靈公之賊以致趙盾，遍告諸將曰：「盾雖不知，猶爲賊首。以臣弒君，子孫在朝，何以懲罪？請誅之。」韓厥曰：「靈公遇賊，趙盾在外，吾先君以爲無罪，故不誅。今諸君將誅其後，是非先君之意而今妄誅。妄誅謂之亂。臣有大事而君不聞，是無君也。」屠岸賈不聽。韓厥告趙朔趣亡。朔不肯，曰：「子必不絶趙祀，朔死不恨。」韓厥許諾，稱疾不出。賈不請而擅與諸將攻趙氏於下宮，殺趙朔、趙同、趙括、趙嬰齊，皆滅其族。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m015-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"晉景公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002269","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m015-0009","start":9,"end":12,"surface":"屠岸賈","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002273","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m015-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"趙氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、神祇、馬匹、校勘或未定稱呼保留；不補名字、成員或闕代，故事說詞不作真孤被殺證據。"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m015-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"趙盾","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002259","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m015-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"叔帶","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002245","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m015-0045","start":45,"end":46,"surface":"盾","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002259","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m015-0055","start":55,"end":58,"surface":"趙史援","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002274","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m015-0095","start":95,"end":98,"surface":"屠岸賈","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002273","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m015-0104","start":104,"end":106,"surface":"靈